From ca71860e67ae155ad9eff59119c335d8357f21d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 0xFFshell <0xffshell@users.noreply.gitlab.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 11:23:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Document the bucket beat

The timing table said the water bucket under a fall is the one item still
grabbed on the tick. It is now asked for on the first tick of a fall that
will need it; the grab survives as the fall's landing guarantee, which is
the only way the beat can be paid out of the tick that needs the water.

Also adds HandWritesTest to the list of tests that cover the rules, and
repairs a literal backslash-n in the table that had glued the landing-rest
row onto the sprint-windup row.
---
